usage: analyze_saved_pair.py [-h] [--validated-receipt VALIDATED_RECEIPT]
                             --output OUTPUT [--runs-root RUNS_ROOT]
                             [--bindings-root BINDINGS_ROOT]

Analyze already validated saved FULL005 histories, without rendering/solver.
Physical and ledger validation transfers from the bound successful prior
receipt. Only necessary history/abundance bytes are streamed once while
hashing. Numeric and alignment prerequisites are checked again; no
ledger/checkpoint is opened.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --validated-receipt VALIDATED_RECEIPT
  --output OUTPUT
  --runs-root RUNS_ROOT
  --bindings-root BINDINGS_ROOT
